<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">24052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Tehran says a fourteen-clause memorandum with Washington is largely negotiated, with Pakistan's army chief carrying the messages between capitals.</s> <s>The framework covers a Lebanon ceasefire, gradual release of frozen Iranian assets, and joint Iran-Oman oversight of the Strait of Hormuz, before any nuclear track opens.</s> <s>Nine Organization of Islamic Cooperation states helped shape the text — the first major Gulf settlement built on regional consensus rather than American-Israeli bilateralism.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>West Bengal's new BJP government has cut the official Eid al-Adha holiday from two days to one, by executive notification four days before the festival.</s> <s>The state holds India's third-largest Muslim population, roughly thirty percent, and joins Uttar Pradesh, Assam, and Madhya Pradesh in compressing Muslim festival calendars without legislation.</s> <s>The Eid al-Fitr two-day holiday hasn't yet been revised, and the legislature sits for five more years.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Bolivia's Chiquitano forest, Rosa Pachurí Paraba and other Monkox women have rebuilt food systems that the state didn't, after last year's wildfires burned twelve point six million hectares of Santa Cruz.</s> <s>Their fire-management collectives are climate adaptation in working form, yet international climate finance still cannot route money to indigenous bodies because no <sub alias="non-governmental organisation">NGO</sub> sits between the donors and the women doing the work.</s> <s>The structural injustice isn't the fire — it's the funding stack that erases them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kyiv has named one hundred and twenty-seven individual Russian officers it says ordered missile strikes on Ukrainian cities, from the Okhmatdyt children's hospital to the village of Hroza.</s> <s>Each sanction lists the officer's specific target, treating military command-chain accountability as a sanctions matter without waiting for an international court.</s> <s>A second package designates twenty-nine Russian-linked merchant vessels in the shadow tanker fleet, which Kyiv plans to synchronise with Western partners.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Forty thousand people marched through Madrid Saturday demanding Prime Minister Pedro Sánchez resign, after Spanish courts charged his wife with embezzlement this week.</s> <s>The probes now reach his brother and a former interior minister whose trials arrive within weeks.</s> <s>Sánchez has pledged to stay, and Spain's prosecutorial machinery is testing whether parliamentary protections hold for an executive's family — a test European democracies rarely run on a sitting prime minister.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pope Leo the Fourteenth visited Acerra, near Naples, and named the dizzying profits behind the cancer deaths there — profits, he said, that flow to the Camorra.</s> <s>The mafia has run industrial waste disposal in Campania since the nineteen eighties, and the European Court of Justice has given Rome two years to register every toxic site.</s> <s>Leo issues his first encyclical Monday, with Italy's compliance deadline running into January.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>East African Community states still cannot resolve whether to ban the imported second-hand clothes — known as mitumba — that gut their domestic textile manufacturers.</s> <s>Nairobi's Gikomba market employs thirty thousand people, and used imports kept Kenyan retail prices accessible through the post-twenty twenty-two cost-of-living surge.</s> <s>Uganda's thirty percent additional tariff is now live; the question is whether anyone else in the bloc dares follow.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The African Development Bank has pledged two hundred million euros to Morocco for vocational training and future-skills programmes, the kind of grievance that drove last year's youth protests in Rabat and Casablanca.</s> <s>Morocco must establish implementation partners before the bank releases the funds.</s> <s>African development finance is shifting from infrastructure megaprojects toward human-capital instruments, and Morocco is the test case for whether the shift actually works.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Jakarta plans a five-hundred-kilometre sea wall along Java's northern coast — the world's largest single climate-adaptation bet.</s> <s>The capital's been sinking up to ten centimetres a year from groundwater extraction, so a wall holds the existing coastline but locks subsidence-driven flood risk behind it.</s> <s>Every coastal megacity in south and southeast Asia will eventually have to answer the same question Indonesia is answering now: hold the line, or retreat.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A solar-driven catalyst has broken down perfluorophenol — a so-called forever chemical — in real industrial wastewater for more than five hundred continuous hours.</s> <s>Sunlight generates hydroxyl radicals on the surface that cleave the carbon-fluorine bonds which make <sub alias="P F A S">PFAS</sub> impossible to neutralize cheaply by any conventional method.</s> <s>American incineration and German activated-carbon cleanup currently price the Global South out of cleaning its own water; this rewrites who can.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Uganda's Ebola outbreak has reached five confirmed cases, after a patient travelled from the Democratic Republic of Congo border through Entebbe and Kampala before testing positive.</s> <s>The Bundibugyo strain has no approved vaccine.</s> <s>Congolese first responders say American aid cuts have left them without protective equipment for the very work that's supposed to keep the virus inside Congo.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>On the Svalbard archipelago, a three-hundred-year-old whaler grave at a site Norwegians call Corpse Point has vanished into the thawing permafrost.</s> <s>Arctic temperatures are rising four times faster than the global average, and once permafrost thaws at a site, Norwegian researchers found, the process cannot be reversed.</s> <s>Every frozen archaeological site on Earth — Mongolian glaciers, Siberian mummies, Alpine ice patches — sits on the same losing clock.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Chinese and American artificial intelligence communities remain a single networked field — sharing preprints, training methods, open weights, and graduate-student alumni — despite Washington's export controls and Beijing's data-localization rules.</s> <s>The only enforcement layer that actually bites is the chip-equipment ban; nothing yet restricts open-weight models or researcher visas.</s> <s>Decoupling makes for clean headlines, but the underlying scientific commons is more durable than either capital admits.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>America's cyber agency has opened its Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalogue to public nominations, letting outside researchers push entries into a list federal agencies must patch within twenty-one days.</s> <s>Until now, the catalogue was populated from classified telemetry alone.</s> <s>The opening arrives in the same week the Trump administration is dismantling other functions inside the same agency, so the durability of the new channel is the open question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The shadow library Anna's Archive, run from servers reachable through Amsterdam, has openly invited artificial intelligence laboratories to bulk-download its corpus of pirated academic books.</s> <s>Instead of restricting access through robots.txt, the archive published the download instructions, daring laboratories to acknowledge what they've quietly trained on.</s> <s>The question of whether laboratories will admit using pirated scholarship has just stopped being a legal abstraction.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
